{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28233","headline":"赠潼关不下山僧 · 李远","name":"赠潼关不下山僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与君同在苦空间，君得空门我爱闲。\n禁足已教修鴈塔，终身不拟下鸡山。\n窗中遥指三千界，枕上斜看百二关。\n香茗一瓯从此别，转蓬流水几时还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}